# Manual tests of general behaviour: health, unknown addresses and content negotiation.
# Pick the environment in the "env" list above the editor.
# host comes from http-client.env.json.

### Health: 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Unknown address: 404 (Problem Details)
GET {{host}}/api/does-not-exist

### List series with an Accept header that cannot be satisfied: 406
GET {{host}}/api/series
Accept: application/xml
